.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/8/88/87zlkkd6yvpkq9c9yobtkmfr9lih1ue.png/120px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E6%B5%B4%E7%81%AB.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/8/88/87zlkkd6yvpkq9c9yobtkmfr9lih1ue.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />浴火\n</th>\n<td class=\"text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:10%;\"><center><b>&#160;技能类别<br /></b>[反应]</center>\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:70%;\">&#160;\n<p>（反应）免疫[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"灼烧\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">灼烧</font></span></span>]及[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">燃烧地形</span>]，处于[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"燃烧\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">燃烧</font></span></span>]地形格上时，受到伤害降低<font color=\"#ed7950\">10%</font>。行动结束时，回复<font color=\"#58cb48\">20%</font>生命值。\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">可习得该技能的角色\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门外</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div>\n<div class=\"hero_head\" style=\"width:70px;height:70px;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E9%BB%91%E6%9A%97%E4%B9%8B%E5%85%89%E7%81%AB%E6%9C%AF%E5%B8%88\" title=\"角色图鉴库/黑暗之光火术师\"><img alt=\"头像 黑暗之光火术师.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/9/93/snlhjs3whflbzc36kw8at8g7o2ab1ul.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" class=\"img-kk\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a></div>\n<div class=\"hero_head_name\" style=\"width:70px;\"><font color=\"#fff\">黑暗之光火术师</font></div>\n</div><div class=\"hero_head\" style=\"width:70px;height:70px;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E4%BD%A3%E5%85%B5%E2%80%9C%E7%82%8E%E4%B9%8